          "start": 3878,
          "end": 3897,
          "excerpt": "          \"token\": \"0x060003a5\",\n          \"symbol\": {\n            \"token\": \"0x060003a5\",\n            \"kind\": \"method-def\",\n            \"type\": \".\\u003C\\u003Ec\",\n            \"name\": \"\\u003CLoadOldLightMoudle\\u003Eb__170_2\",\n            \"parameters\": 1,\n            \"attributes\": \"Assembly, HideBySig\",\n            \"signatureBytes\": \"20010212808c\"\n          },\n          \"status\": \"decoded\",\n          \"issue\": null,\n          \"ilSize\": 17,\n          \"ilSha256\": \"a2c624d3c23b58e027a481bcd852b31d0ed40f237f899a52c1377dab4527dff2\",\n          \"ilBytes\": \"036fcc03000a723947007028b900000a2a\",\n          \"instructions\": [\n            {\n              \"offset\": 0,\n              \"label\": \"IL_0000\",\n              \"opcode\": \"ldarg.1\",",
          "evidenceType": "original-managed-cil",
          "binaryIdentity": "42e2437780ec21c9d1ade2d07ace0a26635961f5c90559934a7fde7e233e0c23 / MVID 77c739a5-b0ec-4834-8a1e-64dd9b618ae5"
        },
        {
          "path": "analysis/decompiled/VisionMaster.Exe.Audit/VisionMaster.AppMainWindow/TitleMenueItemData.cs",
          "member": "Nested menu lookup and display writes",
          "sha256": "b1c349c4808c0ce49c45e6fcca2972d370ed5a8f3e96ac51a157a680b42c9187",
          "start": 1848,
          "end": 1864,
          "excerpt": "\tpublic void LoadOldLightMoudle()\n\t{\n\t\tVmModule vmModule = VmSolution.Instance.Modules.FirstOrDefault((VmModule m) => m.ID == 14000);\n\t\tTitleMenueItemData titleMenueItemData = Items.OfType<TitleMenueItemData>().FirstOrDefault((TitleMenueItemData p) => p.Name == \"Lang_System\");\n\t\tif (titleMenueItemData != null)\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tControllerSet = titleMenueItemData.Items.OfType<TitleMenueItemData>().FirstOrDefault((TitleMenueItemData p) => p.Name == \"Lang_ControllerSet\");\n\t\t\tif (ControllerSet != null)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tTitleMenueItemData controllerSet = ControllerSet;\n\t\t\t\tbool flag = (ControllerSet.IsVisible = vmModule != null);\n\t\t\t\tcontrollerSet.IsDisplayInMenu = flag;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\n\tpublic static void DeleteOldLightModule()",
          "evidenceType": "local-decompiled-source",
          "binaryIdentity": "not revalidated in this slice"
        }
      ],
      "unknowns": [
        "Items可动态生成、null/反射失败、父节点缺失与方案替换后的静态引用状态仍未知；显示字段最终绑定须另核。"
      ],
      "fullBehaviorClosed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MU-L03",
      "chain": "controller-hidden-lifecycle",
      "classification": "source-confirmed",
      "classificationScope": "Only cited original CIL/metadata/resource or local decompiled statements; runtime activation and whole-chain closure remain separate.",
      "from": "H20 LightSet窗口返回后的DeleteOldLightModule",
      "to": "再次读设备集合 → 空集合门 → UI提示/菜单隐藏/模块移除和SDK关闭",
      "behavior": "现有configuration-hosts:H20已定位调用但将旧模块删除条件留未知。补取原方法：找不到14000即返回；否则设ModuleID=14000，GetAuthority/GetData，再取ItemsA。非null且Count==0才显示NoButton提示，并在ControllerSet非null时设IsVisible=false；随后Application.Current.Dispatcher?.Invoke中先VmSolution.Modules.Remove(oldLightMoudle)，再CloseOneModule(oldLightMoudle.ID)，最后置局部null。这里没有读取CloseOneModule返回值，也没有围绕这两个操作做本地回滚。",
