          "start": 188,
          "end": 253,
          "excerpt": "\tpublic void GetData(bool isInnerModule = false, bool isPopErrorInfo = true)\n\t{\n\t\tlock (_lock)\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tint binaryData = ServerSDKManager.serverSDKManager.mModuleManager.GetBinaryData((uint)ModuleID, \"LightDeviceList\", out var data);\n\t\t\ttry\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tif (binaryData > 0)\n\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\tIMVS_LIGHT_DEVICE_LIST list = Marshal.PtrToStructure<IMVS_LIGHT_DEVICE_LIST>(data);\n\t\t\t\t\tDebugger.Log(0, null, \"LightManagerUI：dataLen [\" + binaryData + \"], Items.Count[\" + Items.Count + \"], target.Count[\" + list.nCount + \"]\");\n\t\t\t\t\tif (!CheckDeviceList(list))\n\t\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\t\tLogHelper.Info(\"重新获取控制器列表\");\n\t\t\t\t\t\tneedForceRefresh = false;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tClearDevices();\n\t\t\t\t\t\tbool flag = false;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tfor (int i = 0; i < list.nCount; i++)\n\t\t\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tIMVS_LIGHT_DEVICE item = list.stLightDevice[i];\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tif (AddDevice(item, i))\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tflag = true;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t\t\tif (flag)\n\t\t\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tReFreshIndex();\n\t\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t\t\tif (Items.Count > 0)\n\t\t\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tinstance.CurLightDeviceA = Items[0];\n\t\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\telse\n\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\tClearDevices();\n\t\t\t\t\tif (isPopErrorInfo)\n\t\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\t\tHikMessageBox.Show(AppLocalizationService.GetLang(\"Lang_GetGlobalLightListERR\"), MessageIcons.Error);\n\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tcatch (Exception ex)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tif (isPopErrorInfo)\n\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\tHikMessageBox.Show(ex.Message, MessageIcons.Error);\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tfinally\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tif (data != IntPtr.Zero)\n\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\tMarshal.FreeHGlobal(data);\n\t\t\t\t\tdata = IntPtr.Zero;\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t\tif (!isInnerModule && instance.CurLightDeviceA != null && CurLightDeviceA is LightSourceDevice lightSourceDevice)\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tlightSourceDevice.GetChannelParam();\n\t\t}\n\t}\n",
          "evidenceType": "local-decompiled-source",
